content:
Here are the domain objects:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Client",
      "description": "person requesting a custom furniture piece"
    },
    {
      "name": "Piece Request",
      "description": "initial request describing what furniture the client wants",
      "attributes": [
        "Room Measurements",
        "Style Preference"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Room Measurements",
      "description": "dimensions provided by the client"
    },
    {
      "name": "Style Preference",
      "description": "client’s preferred look and style"
    },
    {
      "name": "Design Draft",
      "description": "early visual and material concept of the furniture",
      "attributes": [
        "Material"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Material",
      "description": "selected materials to be used in the furniture"
    },
    {
      "name": "Furniture Designer",
      "description": "professional who creates and refines the design"
    },
    {
      "name": "Feedback",
      "description": "client’s notes to adjust or approve work"
    },
    {
      "name": "Final Design",
      "description": "approved design blueprint for production"
    },
    {
      "name": "Carpenter",
      "description": "craftsperson building the furniture"
    },
    {
      "name": "Furniture Assembly",
      "description": "construction process for the furniture"
    },
    {
      "name": "Furniture Piece",
      "description": "completed furniture product"
    },
    {
      "name": "Quality Inspector",
      "description": "person responsible for checking quality standards"
    },
    {
      "name": "Standard Check",
      "description": "quality review of the finished piece"
    },
    {
      "name": "Issue Report",
      "description": "notes on problems found during inspection"
    },
    {
      "name": "Delivery Coordinator",
      "description": "person arranging furniture delivery"
    },
    {
      "name": "Delivery",
      "description": "transport of the finished furniture to the client",
      "attributes": [
        "Delivery Time",
        "Furniture Piece"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Delivery Time",
      "description": "scheduled time for delivery"
    }
  ]
}
```

Here are the associations:
```json
{
  "associations": [
    {
      "from": "Client",
      "to": "Piece Request",
      "description": "Client submits the Piece Request"
    },
    {
      "from": "Piece Request",
      "to": "Furniture Designer",
      "description": "Piece Request is passed to the Furniture Designer"
    },
    {
      "from": "Furniture Designer",
      "to": "Design Draft",
      "description": "Furniture Designer creates the Design Draft"
    },
    {
      "from": "Design Draft",
      "to": "Piece Request",
      "description": "Design Draft is aligned with the Piece Request"
    },
    {
      "from": "Client",
      "to": "Design Draft",
      "description": "Client reviews the Design Draft"
    },
    {
      "from": "Client",
      "to": "Feedback",
      "description": "Client provides Feedback"
    },
    {
      "from": "Feedback",
      "to": "Furniture Designer",
      "description": "Feedback is used by the Furniture Designer"
    },
    {
      "from": "Furniture Designer",
      "to": "Final Design",
      "description": "Furniture Designer produces the Final Design"
    },
    {
      "from": "Final Design",
      "to": "Carpenter",
      "description": "Final Design is forwarded to Carpenter"
    },
    {
      "from": "Carpenter",
      "to": "Furniture Assembly",
      "description": "Carpenter performs the Furniture Assembly"
    },
    {
      "from": "Furniture Assembly",
      "to": "Furniture Piece",
      "description": "Furniture Assembly results in the Furniture Piece"
    },
    {
      "from": "Quality Inspector",
      "to": "Standard Check",
      "description": "Quality Inspector performs the Standard Check"
    },
    {
      "from": "Standard Check",
      "to": "Furniture Piece",
      "description": "Standard Check evaluates the Furniture Piece"
    },
    {
      "from": "Quality Inspector",
      "to": "Issue Report",
      "description": "Quality Inspector creates an Issue Report"
    },
    {
      "from": "Issue Report",
      "to": "Carpenter",
      "description": "Issue Report is sent to the Carpenter"
    },
    {
      "from": "Delivery Coordinator",
      "to": "Delivery",
      "description": "Delivery Coordinator arranges the Delivery"
    },
    {
      "from": "Client",
      "to": "Delivery",
      "description": "Client confirms the Delivery"
    },
    {
      "from": "Feedback",
      "to": "Delivery Coordinator",
      "description": "Feedback is shared with the Delivery Coordinator"
    }
  ]
}
```
